     "question": "How many integers must you pick from {1,...,20} to guarantee two that sum to 21?",
     "answer": "11",
     "why": "The pairs are {1,20}, {2,19}, ..., {10,11} - 10 boxes. Picking 10 could take one from each pair, so 11 forces a complete pair."
